INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `vendor_id`, `name`, `slug`, `thumbnail`, `description`, `matrix1`, `matrix2`, `gst`, `lot_number`, `average_ratings`, `ratings_count`, `nonreturnable`, `is_offer`, `is_top_selling`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `show_in_home`) VALUES
(1, 1, 1, NULL, 'Hand Pounded Brown Rice/ Kaikuthal Arisi', 'Hand-Pounded-Brown-Rice--Kaikuthal-Arisi-1805', 'Hand-Pounded-Brown-Rice-947231906-01_20_2023_11_55_am.jpg', '<p>Hand Pound Rice( Kaikuthal) Brown Rice is a whole grain meal. It contains nutritious vitamin B, phosphorus, selenium, manganese, potassium and magnesium.</p>', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 0, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Active', '2023-01-20 11:55:47', '2023-01-20 12:03:37', 'Yes'),
(2, 1, 1, NULL, 'BB Royal Organic Brown Rice/Arisi, 10 kg', 'BB-Royal-Organic-Brown-Rice-Arisi,-10-kg-3771', '40127666-2_4-bb-royal-organic-brown-rice-1197921623-01_20_2023_12_00_pm.jpg', '<p>BB Royal Brown rice is a great option for a delicious, nutritious and healthy quick-cooking rice meal. Rich in fiber and natural goodness and also has a delicious nutty flavour. It is processed with unique hydration enhancement technology which retains all the essential nutrients, making Daawat brown rice India&#39;s only quick-cooking brown rice. It has vital health benefits and tastes much better than regular brown rice. There is a whole lot of variation between white rice and brown rice, and the most essential one being, unlike white rice, brown rice has not lost its completeness.</p>', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 0, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Active', '2023-01-20 12:00:33', '2023-01-20 12:02:02', 'Yes'),
(3, 1, 1, NULL, 'Nimbark Organic Brown Basmati Rice | Basmati Rice | Brown Rice | Basmati Brown Chawal 1kg', 'Nimbark-Organic-Brown-Basmati-Rice-|-Basmati-Rice-|-Brown-Rice-|-Basmati-Brown-Chawal-1kg-9287', 'Nimbark Organic Brown Basmati Rice 1 kg 600 x 600-1367591010-01_20_2023_12_04_pm.jpg', '<p>From the foothills of Jammu &amp; Kashmir,&nbsp;<strong>NIMBARK&nbsp;</strong>is offering&nbsp;<strong>100% Organic Brown Basmati Rice</strong>&nbsp;with a distinct aroma and subtle taste. Its grain is long, slender with narrow width and it is a healthier substitute of the regular range of Basmati Rice.&nbsp;<strong>Buy Organic Brown Basmati Rice</strong>&nbsp;from a trusted brand like&nbsp;<strong>NIMBARK</strong>&nbsp;which procures this variety from the farmers cultivating this cereal crop in the valleys of the Himalayas by employing organic means. Organic rice cultivation is gaining popularity in India, as people are more aware nowadays of the chemicals &amp; pesticides used in normal farming practices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At NIMBARK, we support organic farming &amp; procurement of products that too at a reasonable cost. Thus, no polishing or chemicals are used in the packaging of these&nbsp;<strong>Organic Brown Basmati Rice &ndash; 1Kg</strong>. Traditionally, Brown Basmati Rice is consumed worldwide along with various other recipes. But,&nbsp;<strong>Biryani (Veg as well as non-veg)</strong>is one of the most popular recipes in every corner of India which includes this rice as the main ingredient along with other aromatic spices like saffron, cardamom &amp; clove.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although, cooking of these Long Grain Brown Basmati Rice (Organic) is very simple but the following steps can be followed to retain its distinct aroma and nutty taste:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Cooking instructions for 1 cup of rice in a pan:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Soak rice in water for 30 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Boil two cups of water, add soaked rice into the boiling water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Add salt to taste along with a teaspoon of butter, margarine, or cooking oil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. You may also add green peas, carrots, or mix vegetables to your likings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Left it simmers on low heat until most of the water is absorbed into the rice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Turn off the stove, and let the rice stand for 10 mins. With the lid on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. Gently puff up rice, and serve.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Cooking instructions for 1 cup of rice in a rice cooker:&nbsp;</strong>​</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Add one cup of rice with 2 1/4 cups of water in a rice cooker.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Add salt, cooking oil, and vegetables to your likings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Switch on the rice cooker.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Once ready, it will automatically turn off.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. When ready, gently puff up rice, and serve.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Health Benefits</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>NIMBARK Organic Brown Basmati Rice</strong>&nbsp;comes with an impressive list of health benefits at the most competitive price. A few of them are mentioned below:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>100% organic means reducing the health risks.</li>\r\n	<li>Good choice for people who need to care for their blood glucose levels.</li>\r\n	<li>Including&nbsp;<strong>Nimbark Long Grain Organic Brown Basmati Rice</strong>&nbsp;in your diet will provide you high fiber(good for normal bowel movement), carbohydrates as well as Vitamin B(including Thiamine).</li>\r\n	<li>This variety of Organic Brown Basmati Rice may offer neuroprotective action.</li>\r\n	<li>It may assist in controlling cholesterol catabolism.</li>\r\n	<li>It may be beneficial for healthy bones due to the presence of some micronutrients like magnesium and calcium.</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 0, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Active', '2023-01-20 12:04:36', '2023-01-20 12:06:04', 'Yes'),
(4, 1, 1, NULL, 'India Gate - Brown Basmati Rice 1kg', 'India-Gate-Brown-Basmati-Rice-1kg-6919', 'shopping-1730846645-01_20_2023_12_09_pm.webp', '<p>India Gate Weight Watchers Special Brown Rice is not just tasty but also is the best rice option for people who count their calorie intake. It releases energy slowly thereby keeping your stomach feeling full for a longer period of time. Although the usual Brown Rice takes time to cook, India Gate Weight Watchers Special Brown Rice takes just about 15 minutes to get cooked. The rice is high in fibre and loaded with several essential minerals. It has a low GI which keeps the heart healthy and helps in maintaining a healthy blood sugar level.</p>', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 0, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Active', '2023-01-20 12:09:49', '2023-01-20 12:11:27', 'Yes'),
(5, 1, 2, NULL, 'India Gate India Gate basmati-rice-mograbroken 5 kg Bag, 5 kg Bag', 'India-Gate-India-Gate-basmati-rice-mograbroken-5-kg-Bag,-5-kg-Bag-5049', '40000750_2-india-gate-basmati-rice-mograbroken-1620361806-01_20_2023_12_13_pm.webp', '<p>From the World&#39;s No. 1 Basmati Rice* brand, India Gate Mogra Basmati Rice is budget-friendly for everyday use and makes ordinary meals delightful. It is defined by its shorter than normal Basmati grains and distinguished aroma and texture. For those who prefer a value-for-money product for daily consumption, this distinctly aromatic and flavorful variant will take care of your inclination and make every meal memorable. The grains elongate up to three times their original length when cooked. It is aged for a minimum of 1.5 years which results in better volume, fluffiness, yield and imparts distinct basmati aroma and taste. The India Gate Mogra basmati rice is produced with international quality standards, cleaned, sorted and packed in superior, hygienic and state-of-the-art facilities, completely untouched by human hands.</p>', NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, 0, 0, 'No', 'No', 'Yes', 'Active', '2023-01-20 12:13:50', '2023-01-20 12:14:25', 'Yes'),
